{"book":"genesis","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T10:28:21.780953030Z","verse":26,"ref":"genesis 44:26","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":44,"translation":"And we said, 'We are not able to go down. If our brother, the youngest, ⟨is⟩ with ⟨את⟩ us, then we will go down, for we are not able to see ⟨the⟩ face of the man if our brother, the youngest, is not with ⟨את⟩ us.'","tokens":[{"surface":"ונאמר","gloss":"And we said"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"נוכל","gloss":"we are able"},{"surface":"לרדת","gloss":"to go down"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"If"},{"surface":"יש","gloss":"there is"},{"surface":"אחינו","gloss":"our brother"},{"surface":"הקטן","gloss":"the youngest"},{"surface":"אתנו","gloss":"with ⟨את⟩ us"},{"surface":"וירדנו","gloss":"then we will go down"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"נוכל","gloss":"we are able"},{"surface":"לראות","gloss":"to see"},{"surface":"פני","gloss":"face of"},{"surface":"האיש","gloss":"the man"},{"surface":"ואחינו","gloss":"and our brother"},{"surface":"הקטן","gloss":"the youngest"},{"surface":"איננו","gloss":"is not"},{"surface":"אתנו","gloss":"with ⟨את⟩ us"}]}